# Copy to .env for local development. .env is git-ignored.

# --- Access assertion for `pnpm dev` (ADR 0020) ---
# The backend verifies a signed Cloudflare Access assertion on every /api call. In
# dev there is no Cloudflare in front, so the /api proxy attaches this pre-minted
# token instead (server/routes/api/[...].ts). Without it every request 401s.
#
# Mint one — it is signed with the committed non-production key, so this is not a
# secret and anyone can regenerate it. From this directory:
#
#   pnpm mint-token
#
# Unset in production, where the browser's real assertion is forwarded verbatim.
TUCKER_DEV_ACCESS_TOKEN=

# --- API upstream ---
# Where the /api proxy forwards to. Defaults to http://localhost:8080 (the backend
# container from the repo-root docker-compose.yml), so this is only needed if the
# backend is somewhere else.
# TUCKER_API_UPSTREAM=
